  (W, "A pay to witness script hash output, P2WSH, is the segregated witness equivalent of pay to script hash. The book takes it from the multisignature of Mohammed's company: the output script is 0 followed by the 32-byte hash of the witness script, and the spend puts the signatures and the script in the witness, with an empty input script. The segregated witness script is a lot simpler than the legacy one and reduces the template overhead of the legacy form [AH]."),
