 Qe("bip-0173.mediawiki", "This document proposes a checksummed base32 format, \"Bech32\"", "Base58 needs a lot of space in QR codes, as it cannot use the ''alphanumeric mode''.", "The mixed case in base58 makes it inconvenient to reliably write down, type on mobile keyboards, or read out loud.", "The double SHA256 checksum is slow and has no error-detection guarantees.", "A Bech32<ref>'''Why call it Bech32?'''", "is at most 90 characters long", "The '''separator''', which is always \"1\".", "excluding \"1\", \"b\", \"i\", and \"o\"", "Mainnet P2WPKH: <tt>bc1qw508d6qejxtdg4y5r3zarvary0c5xw7kv8f3t4</tt>", "Mainnet P2WSH: <tt>bc1qrp33g0q5c5txsp9arysrx4k6zdkfs4nce4xj0gdcccefvpysxf3qccfmv3</tt>", "The P2WSH examples use <tt>key OP_CHECKSIG</tt> as script."),
